DTest is an independent implementation, in the D programming language, of the
testing model popularised by GoogleTest (https://github.com/google/googletest).
The TEST / TEST_F macros, the EXPECT_* / ASSERT_* assertion families, the
fixture lifecycle, the command-line flags, and the console output format are
deliberately modelled on GoogleTest so that its documentation and habits carry
over.

